## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates understanding of end-to-end testing for real-time media systems at scale, with emphasis on synchronization verification, fault injection, and observability under production-like conditions.

## Key Concepts

- Large-scale WebRTC testing with synthetic clients
- Network emulation including latency, jitter, and packet loss profiles
- Audio-video synchronization verification
- Recording integrity and consistency across media servers
- Burst load testing and stress testing methodologies
- Signaling and media path coordination

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudocode for WebRTC E2E test harness
class WebRTCE2EHarness {
  constructor(config) {
    this.rooms = [];
    this.networkProfiles = config.networkProfiles;
    this.statsInterval = config.statsIntervalMs || 1000;
  }

  async createRoom(participants, networkProfile) {
    const room = new Room(participants, networkProfile);
    await room.initialize();
    this.rooms.push(room);
    return room;
  }

  async runBurstLoadTest(options) {
    const { roomCount, participantsPerRoom, staggerDelay } = options;
    for (let i = 0; i < roomCount; i++) {
      await this.createRoom(participantsPerRoom, this.getRandomProfile());
      await this.sleep(staggerDelay);
    }
  }

  collectMetrics() {
    return this.rooms.flatMap(room => room.getRTCStats());
  }

  verifyRecordingSync(recording1, recording2) {
    const drift = Math.abs(recording1.timestamp - recording2.timestamp);
    return drift < 50; // 50ms tolerance
  }
}
```

## Why This Is Asked

Tests for multi-tenant isolation are foundational for SaaS apps. The goal is to confirm UI and API boundaries prevent cross-tenant data leakage, a common subtle bug.

## Key Concepts

- Multi-tenancy data isolation
- Role-based access control (RBAC)
- Deterministic fixtures for repeatable runs
- UI vs API boundary testing

## Code Example

```javascript
// Cypress skeleton for tenant isolation
describe('Tenant isolation', () => {
  beforeEach(() => {
    seedTenants(['A','B']);
  });
  it('creates user in A and enforces isolation', () => {
    cy.visit('/login');
    cy.login('adminA','A');
    cy.visit('/admin/users');
    cy.get('[data-cy=create-user]').click();
    cy.get('[data-cy=username]').type('newuser');
    cy.get('[data-cy=save]').click();
    cy.contains('newuser').should('exist');
    cy.request({method:'GET', url:'/api/users?tenant=A'}).then(resp => {
      expect(resp.body.some(u => u.username==='newuser')).to.be.true;
    });
    cy.request({method:'GET', url:'/api/users?tenant=B'}).then(resp => {
      expect(resp.body.some(u => u.username==='newuser')).to.be.false;
    });
  });
});
```

